~ start
set guard_started = true
Guard: Hold it right there, prince. If you want to pass, you’ll have to defeat me. No one gets by the Cutter of Fate without proving their worth!
Guard: I’ll give you a hint... I love cutting things. Snipping, slicing, chopping—nothing beats the thrill of a clean cut! Think you’re up for the challenge?
Guard: Come on! Don’t tell me you’re scared already. Let’s see what you’ve got!
=> countdown

~ countdown
Guard: 3...2...1...[next=auto]
=> result
	
~ result
set processing = true
: Prince played: {{player_move}}
	Guard played: {{guard_move}}
	
	Prince {{outcome}} 
if round_score == 1
	set player_score = player_score + 1
else if round_score == -1
	set guard_score = guard_score + 1
set processing = false
if player_score == winner_score:
	Prince wins the match!
	set guard_finished = true
	set player_score = 0
	set guard_score = 0
	Guard: Impossible! You... you beat me? Hah! I guess even the sharpest blade has its limits. Fine, prince, you win this time. Go on, pass... but don’t think I’ll make it this easy next time!
	=> END
if guard_score == winner_score:
	Prince loses the match...
	Guard: Ha! I win! Did you really think you could outsmart the Cutter of Fate? Guess what? It’s over for you, prince. Back to where you started! Maybe next time, you’ll come prepared.
	- Rematch
		set player_score = 0
		set guard_score = 0
		=> start	
=> countdown